1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:02,591
Hey Digital Pioneer, welcome back.

2
00:00:02,991 --> 00:00:05,068
Look at you, showing up again.

3
00:00:05,468 --> 00:00:07,544
That's what this is all about.

4
00:00:07,744 --> 00:00:10,266
So yesterday you made your phone
easier to read.

5
00:00:10,266 --> 00:00:11,968
Today we're going to set up three

6
00:00:11,968 --> 00:00:15,625
little tools that honestly changed
my week when I first learned them.

7
00:00:15,625 --> 00:00:17,390
Things like telling your phone to

8
00:00:17,390 --> 00:00:19,155
remind you about your medication

9
00:00:19,155 --> 00:00:21,173
instead of writing it on
a sticky note.

10
00:00:21,173 --> 00:00:24,262
Or checking tomorrow's weather
without turning on the TV.

11
00:00:24,262 --> 00:00:26,027
Or downloading your pharmacy app

12
00:00:26,027 --> 00:00:28,612
so you can refill a prescription
from your couch.

13
00:00:28,812 --> 00:00:30,825
None of this is complicated.

14
00:00:31,025 --> 00:00:32,980
Your phone already knows
how to do it.

15
00:00:33,180 --> 00:00:35,004
We just need to turn it on.

16
00:00:35,404 --> 00:00:36,660
Five minutes.

17
00:00:37,060 --> 00:00:38,254
Three tools.

18
00:00:38,654 --> 00:00:39,721
You and me.

19
00:00:40,121 --> 00:00:41,126
Let's go.

